e demon when it's angry. go to the basement for mice's pentagram and burn the mices there, but don't forget, doing this ritual when the demon isn't angry will cause it to enrage but if you do it while it's angry it will cause it to calm down<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CAN YOU DESTROY THE DEMON?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Increasing Difficulty</strong><br>The demon will get more angry after every ritual.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Replayability</strong><br>You can get together with your crew and find new mysteries and have new experiences with randomized items every game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Multiplayer Feature</strong><br>You need to work as a team to win the game. Making correct decisions and stopping the demon is in your and your team's hands.</li></ul><br>",
